                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">溫馨提醒：</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">• </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">為確保行程準時開始，請您至少提前 5 分鐘抵達現場。</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">• </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">若需取消或變更參觀時間，敬請務必提前通知，以便為您重新安排相關事宜。<br /> 若您在參觀前有任何問題，歡迎隨時與我們聯繫。<br /><br /> 我們期待在花旗參園與您見面！</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">此致</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">導覽員</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">,{{{Case.Tour_Guide__c}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hsu's Ginseng Enterprises, Inc.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><br /> &nbsp;</td>
