                       </colgroup>
                       
                        <tr>
                         <td style="border-bottom:1px solid #000000; vertical-align:top; padding:0px 7px 0px 7px; border-top:1px solid #000000; border-right:1px solid #000000; border-left:1px solid #000000; width:623px"><p style="line-height:1.3900000000000001; text-align:center; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="overflow:hidden"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Quattrocento Sans',sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">📌</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">温馨提醒：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.3900000000000001; text-align:center; margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">- </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">参观费用为每人$5，可于当日在本店消费时全额抵扣。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">• 全程导览时间约为 1 至 1.5 小时，实际时间视当日情况略有调整。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">• 由于参观活动部分为户外行程，天气状况可能影响整体体验。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center">&nbsp;</p>
                          <hr /><p style="line-height:1.3900000000000001; text-align:center; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="overflow:hidden"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Quattrocento Sans',sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">📞</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">联络方式</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="overflow:hidden"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">电话： (715) 675-2325 / (1800) 826-1577</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Email：support@hsuginseng.com</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.3900000000000001; text-align:center; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">网站：</span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="http://www.hsuginseng.com/" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1155cc"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">www.hsuginseng.com</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><br /> &nbsp;</p>
                          <hr /><p style="line-height:1.3900000000000001; text-align:center; margin-bottom:11px"><span style="overflow:hidden"><span style="overflow-wrap:break-word"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Quattrocento Sans',sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">🕒</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Aptos"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">客服时间：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">周一至周五（国定假日除外）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">早上 8:30 至 下午 5:00 （美中时间）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.2; text-align:center">&nbsp;</p></td>
